Package: geofbds
Title: Download and Read Municipal Data from Geo FBDS
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Karlo", "Guidoni", , "kguidonimartins@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Discovers, downloads, and reads geospatial land-use,
    hydrography, and permanent preservation area (APP) data published
    by the Fundacao Brasileira para o Desenvolvimento Sustentavel
    (FBDS) for Brazilian municipalities. Provides a resolver from IBGE
    geocode, municipality name, or state (UF) to a frozen internal
    catalog, parallel resumable downloads via curl, and an auditable
    manifest of every transfer.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/kguidonimartins/geofbds, https://kguidonimartins.github.io/geofbds/
BugReports: https://github.com/kguidonimartins/geofbds/issues
